Warnings
========

This is alpha level software that is sure to have bugs.
Having said that it does seem to work pretty well for me.

There are known securiy holes, such as using exec() which transmits login
and password information across the net in the clear (is there an
secure exec() somewhere?).

This alpha release is more of a concept demonstration than a finished
product.

Supported Platforms
===================

Solaris, Linux, MS Windows

